      "writtenOn": "2012-03-01T21:13:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sometime around e2 or e3, Keystone standardized \u0026 documented the following variables:\n\n    X-Identity-Status\n    X-Authorization\n    X-Tenant-Id\n    X-Tenant-Name\n    X-User-Id\n    X-User-Name\n    X-Roles\n\nBut continued to support the following for compatibility:\n\n    X-User (duplicates X-User-Name)\n    X-Tenant (duplicates X-Tenant-Id)\n    X-Role (duplicates X-Roles)\n\nOne of the other auth projects at Rackspace followed that standardized list... I\u0027d recommend doing the same here.",
      "revId": "c431cc56516d406820926ccf524c649ffb3a24e9",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
      "unresolved": false
    },
